<p class="MsoBodyText" align="center"><span lang="EN-GB">Naar aanleiding van het
boek <b><i>‘Stop Zinloos Geweld’</i></b> organiseert de auteur een 10-delige
cursus weerbaarheid.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
12.0pt"><br>
<b><i><u>Start:</u></i></b> vanaf 20 april.<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
12.0pt"><br>
<b><i><u>Wanneer:</u></i></b> telkens op vrijdag van 19.00 tot 20.00 uur.<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
12.0pt"><br>
<b><i><u>Waar: </u></i></b>in het centrum van Meise.<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
12.0pt">&nbsp;<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><b><i><u><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt">Wie: </span></u></i></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt">iedereen
welkom ongeacht leeftijd!<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span><o:p>
</o:p>
</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><b><i><u><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt">&nbsp;<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></u></i></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><b><i><u><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt">Inschrijvingen en info:</span></u><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt">
</span></i></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto:johny.verheyden@yahoo.com">johny.verheyden@yahoo.com</a></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><span lang="EN-GB"><br>
<span style="mso-spacerun:
yes">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt">0473/869482<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><i><u><span lang="EN-GB">Wat is
weerbaarheid?</span></u></i><span lang="EN-GB"><br>
<br>
<i>Alertheid, zelfvertrouwen, assertiviteit.</i><br>
<i>Conflict controle.</i><span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp;</span><br>
<i>Gemakkelijke, simpele technieken om zich te kunnen bevrijden.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp;</span><br>
Geen agressie, geen gevaarlijke technieken, geen vechtsport, geen
conditietraining.<br>
Positieve en ontspannen sfeer.</i><br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
<br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;<o:p>
</o:p>
</span></p>
